# the option is an object with a method of its own that the conversion calls: the bag goes to what nobody sees, as it did: nobody knows who writes its fields
# The locale is the one that is written all the same. Native code that holds the bag finds `constructor` by the protocol and asks what it finds for Symbol.species alone: Intl.NumberFormat has none, so nobody calls it out of sight.
